1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,898
A point on that graph only makes sense if the gas is in thermodynamic equilibrium.

2
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:08,111
That means three things at once.

3
00:00:08,111 --> 00:00:12,473
Mechanical equilibrium: no unbalanced pressure.

4
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:16,302
Thermal equilibrium: one uniform temperature.

5
00:00:16,302 --> 00:00:20,559
And chemical equilibrium: no reaction in progress.

